000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TVCSTREV.
000400 INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
000600*REMARKS.       THIS PROGRAM SHOWS ALL WORK ORDERS THAT  HAVE
000700*               BEEN COMPLETED IN THE LAST 24 HOURS SORTED BY
000800*               ZONE AND EXPENSE CLASS. ACTUAL COSTS OF LABOR
000900*               AND MATERIAL ARE REPORTED.
001000*
001100*               WHEN SUBMITTED THRU 'XRSCREEN' , THE USER CAN
001200*               RESTRICT THE REPORT TO CERTAIN ZONES. ALSO  ,
001300*               THE USER DETERMINES THE TIME FRAME.
      *C
      *C  09/16/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY FOR STOP AND START DATES AND
      *C   COMPARISONS OF COMPLETION DATE.  ALSO USE THE
      *C   JULGREG ROUTINE FOR GREG/JULIAN DATE CONVERSION.
      *C
001500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS400.
001800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
002100 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002200 FILE-CONTROL.
002300     SELECT IL-FILE
002400         ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MR6IL
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
002500         ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
002600         RELATIVE KEY IS ACT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS IL-STATUS.
003100     SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
002700     SELECT R6FILE
002800         ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMR6FIL
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002900         ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS R6-STATUS.
003200     SELECT SORT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORTFILE.
           SELECT WO-BASIC-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1002
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WBF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LABOR-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WLF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS ARG-NO
               FILE STATUS IS WLNU-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-PARTS-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WPF-STATUS.
