006400         10  FILLER                PIC X.
006500     05  EXPCLASS-SORT             PIC X(8).
006600     05  WODESC-SORT               PIC X(30).
006700     05  CRAFT1-SORT               PIC XX.
006800     05  CRAFT2-SORT               PIC XX.
006900     05  CRAFT3-SORT               PIC XX.
007000     05  FCODE-SORT.
